<title>USA: Converse files to sell 4.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Converse files to sell 4.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH READING, Mass. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Converse Inc said Monday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for an offering of 4.5 million shares.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be applied to the repayment of debt, the company said.</p>
<p>The managing underwriters for the offering are Smith Barney Inc, Dillon Read &amp; Co Inc and Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, Converse said.</p>
